  "description": "MODEL LICENSE: LFM Open License v1.0, not MIT or Apache-2.0. Commercial use of LFM3 is licensed only to entities below USD 10 million annual revenue (section 5); read LICENSE.txt in the package before use. LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B text generation on ONNX Runtime (Liquid's ONNX export LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B-ONNX, revision c680759a): the LFM3 chat template for text turns, a managed greedy decode loop over the export's step graph with its convolution and attention caches, and the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers profile lfm3-bpe-chat). Ships the asset lock, not the weights; acquire them explicitly. The application adds the ONNX Runtime native package. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
